  "title": "Cathy McDermott Awarded 2025 Steven J. Bresky Chairman’s Club Award",
  "summary": "Grace Jacobson Communications Specialist Seaboard Foods Cathy McDermott, inside sales manager, was named the 2025 recipient of the Steven J. Bresky Chairman’s Club Award—Seaboard Foods’ highest sales honor—during the Annual Sales Meeting on February 5. The Chairman’s Club Award honors the legacy of Steven J. Bresky, a visionary leader and the third generation of the […]",
